    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Blood Legion",
    "summary": "At the end of each phase, check each enemy unit that a **LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE** unit of yours **destroyed** in it. An objective marker stays under your control if both apply:\n\n- The enemy unit was in range of the marker when the phase started.\n- The destroying unit has the higher **[Level of Control](vsdata:core-rule/level-of-control)** at the marker.\n\nIt stays yours until a phase ends with your opponent ahead of you on [Level of Control](vsdata:core-rule/level-of-control) for that marker.",
